{"id": "70185", "title": "最佳贱偶", "author": "容光", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 31, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/70/70185.htm", "intro": "匹配度测试结果表明：程先生和秦小姐相爱的可能性为0.01％。\r\n    程先生嘴贱，皮厚，幼稚，霸气，简直是小言男主的变异品种。\r\n    不过秦小姐很大度，为了维护世界和平，总得有人牺牲小我。\r\n    于是她决定收服程先生，一对最佳贱偶由此诞生。\r\n    * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * *\r\n    关于本文不得不说的那些事儿：\r\n    1.本文又名：《我想杀了男主角》or《你绝对没有见过这么贱的男主角》\r\n    2.男主角属性很神奇，绝对够接地气，友情提示：阅读将会有喷屏风险。\r\n    3.目测前方有微量狗血出没，太较真的小伙伴可以紧急刹车，切勿追尾。", "base": "files/article/html/70/70185", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "第01章", "file": "10879681.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第02章", "file": "10879682.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第03章", "file": "10879683.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第04章", "file": "10879684.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第05章", "file": "10879685.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第06章", "file": "10879686.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第07章", "file": "10879687.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第08章", "file": "10879688.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第09章", "file": "10879689.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10章", "file": "10879690.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11章", "file": "10879691.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12章", "file": "10879692.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13章", "file": "10879693.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14章", "file": "10879694.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15章", "file": "10879695.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16章", "file": "10879696.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17章", "file": "10879697.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18章", "file": "10879698.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19章", "file": "10879699.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20章", "file": "10879700.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-25", "file": "10879701.html", "available": false}, {"title": "26-30", "file": "10879702.html", "available": false